#
# AWINIC_NV Driver
#

config AWINIC_NV
	tristate "Awinic pdlc nv driver"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Say Y here if you have Awinic pdlc nv controller
	  chip in your system.
	  If unsure, say N.
	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called awinic_nv driver.
